<title>UK: Denmark sets $300 mln Dec 2002 zero coupon bond.</title>
<headline>Denmark sets $300 mln Dec 2002 zero coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager PaineWebber.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DENMARK</p>
<p> AMT	  $300 MLN  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    23.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  69.10     PAY DATE    23.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.20	REOFFER    69.10     SPREAD	+8 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  DENMARK   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.125 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 31.DEC.01</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
